Meet the Capillary-Cleanse, a revolutionary toothbrush that leverages the power of liquid surface tension to remove debris. Instead of rigid bristles, this device features a dense array of microscopic, hydrophilic channels etched into a flexible polymer head. Each channel acts as a capillary tube, drawing water and cleaning agents into the interstices of your teeth with incredible precision. The geometry is designed so that the liquid film adheres to the tooth surface via van der Waals forces, while the capillary action wicks the debris-laden fluid away from the gum line and into a central collection reservoir. This mechanism effectively traps food particles and plaque within the liquid matrix before flushing them out. The result is a gentle, non-abrasive cleaning process that relies on fluid dynamics rather than mechanical scrubbing. By utilizing the natural affinity of water for hydrophilic surfaces, the Capillary-Cleanse ensures that even the most stubborn debris is effortlessly removed, leaving your teeth clean and healthy without the risk of enamel erosion associated with traditional brushing methods.ต้อน
